", "text": "### 4.1 Eligibility Overview & Starter Exclusion

If CloudScale fails to meet its monthly uptime commitment, eligible customers may request a Service Credit. Service Credits represent a percentage discount credited against future monthly invoices.

Starter Tier Exclusion: The Starter tier is expressly excluded from receiving service credits. Starter tier customers receive 0% service credits under all circumstances.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

