", "text": "### 4.4 Credit Rules and Maximum Limitations

- Monthly Cap: Total service credits issued in any single calendar month shall not exceed 100% of the customer's monthly recurring fee for that month.
- Non-Refundable: Service credits cannot be exchanged for cash refunds, wire transfers, or credit card chargebacks.
- Sole Financial Remedy: Service credits constitute the customer's sole and exclusive financial remedy for downtime.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

