", "text": "### 1.2 Subscription Cycles and Billing Options

CloudScale offers two recurring subscription billing options for enterprise accounts:

- Monthly Billing Cycle: Subscriptions are invoiced every 30 calendar days in advance. This option provides operational agility with no long-term contractual commitment.
- Annual Billing Cycle: Subscriptions are prepaid in advance for a continuous 12-month period. Clients selecting the annual billing cycle receive an immediate 15% upfront discount relative to standard monthly rates across all compute tiers and base platform licenses.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

