", "text": "### 1.3 Automatic Subscription Renewal

All enterprise subscriptions renew automatically at the expiration of the active billing period to guarantee uninterrupted service:

- Monthly Plans: Renew automatically every 30 days unless cancelled at least 48 hours prior to the next billing date.
- Annual Plans: Renew automatically for successive 12-month terms unless a written cancellation notice is received at least 30 calendar days prior to the annual contract expiration anniversary date.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

