", "text": "### 5.2 Sales Tax and Value-Added Tax (VAT) Regulations

All fees quoted and billed by CloudScale are exclusive of applicable taxes, statutory levies, and customs duties:

- United States Sales Tax: CloudScale collects applicable state and local sales taxes based on the customer's registered primary billing address, compliant with state economic nexus standards.
- European Union VAT: VAT is assessed based on the customer's EU member state standard rate. Enterprise customers possessing a verified EU VAT Identification Number are invoiced under the VAT reverse-charge mechanism (0% VAT).", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

