", "text": "### 1.4 Plan Upgrades, Downgrades, and Prorated Billing

- Plan Upgrades: Customers may upgrade subscription tiers or add compute nodes at any time. Upgrades take effect immediately. CloudScale assesses a prorated charge for the remaining days of the current billing cycle, charged immediately to the payment method on file.
- Plan Downgrades: Reductions in computing capacity or tier downgrades take effect only at the start of the next billing cycle. Mid-term credits, cash refunds, or prorated reimbursements are not issued for capacity reductions made during an active cycle.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

